<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-F001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-F001" ;
  triage:title "tests/*.rs files are include!'d into src/, invisible to src-scoped boundary/lint scanners" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BA3-QA2-1789189465, PR #1402, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643745166. Multiple phase-BA test files are include!'d directly into src/ modules rather than compiled as ordinary integration tests under tests/, which makes their content invisible to boundary/lint scanners that are scoped to src/ only. Confirmed occurrences: feature/ba3-nudge-invariant (herdr_nudge_invariant.rs), feature/ba5-queue-ephemeral-item (herdr_queue_ephemeral.rs), fix/phase-ba-cleanup (herdr_queue_no_delivery.rs). fenix's ruling: correlate as one finding across all three worktrees rather than filing three separate records." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "boundary-guard" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "repo-wide grep for include!(...) pulling a tests/*.rs or *_test.rs file into a src/ module" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T05:27:38Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 2026-09-12T05:32:23Z): promotion target is the post-landing review-findings stack (deferred) -- a scanner-scope design question, not an immediate fix dispatch. Do not set a live gh-stack layer as promoteTo until that design question resolves." ;
  triage:deferredNote "PHASE BA CLOSEOUT (fenix, ATM 01M2A7443Z9R020ABEPJFJHAJC, 2026-09-12T07:08:18Z): promoted off the post-landing deferred set onto the review-findings stack -- solar review-3 item B1, fix/phase-ba-review-3 (base fix/phase-ba-review-2 once rebased). In progress." ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A9SVX16WV1SV9NGGHQ7919, 2026-09-12T07:55:08Z): fixed at review-3 a7877cdbd (B1: #[path] test modules moved under src/herdr_queue_wake/tests/ and crates/atm/src/commands/task/tests/ with #![cfg(test)], boundary_enforcement scanners skip test-only sources; solar's original report 01M2A75SMQ at 85e83e577 pre-rebase, quality-mgr independently verified per 01M2A80ZWRGBAFTR9GMXGGRK0V); gate-green on the rebased head 8ebad9606." ;
  triage:promoteTo "fix/phase-ba-review-3" ;
